 "mandatory_caption_caveat": "v2_07 ACCEPTED DOCUMENTED LIMITATION. The error bars are the sample standard deviation across five training seeds (ddof=1); they are NOT confidence intervals. No image-clustered evaluation interval exists for this family: row-level reconstruction was attempted and stopped by a point-estimate reproduction mismatch, and one of forty cells differs from reconstruction by one numerically tied row. The 40k end of the narrowing is supported by the clustered evidence in Figure VE0-FIG-02; the 250k end is not.",
